# anti-B0 -> D_s*+ anti-K0 e- nu (PHSP), isospin partner of Bplus/DsstkKenu (B+ -> D_s*- K+
# e+ nu). See decfiles/cocktail/B0/DsKenu/decay.dec for the isospin-assignment reference. BR
# fixed to 0 in this cocktail component (see config.yaml) -- included for
# categorization/gap-accounting completeness, not as an SM contribution.

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0  B0sig  anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
1.0  D_s*+  anti-K0  e-  anti-nu_e   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

End
